description: >-
  Evidence database, cross-modal terminology mapping, and rubric benchmark
  for the HealthLens eight-axis integrated steady-state framework (A-H).
  Includes 120-case evidence database with per-entry DOI verification status
  (honestly reported: 14 verified / 120 total; 91 entries are synthetic
  validation fixtures), four-way terminology mapping (GB/T 20348-2026 <->
  eight axes <-> Western pathways <-> classical texts), classical Chinese
  medicine text fragments with axis annotations (613 entries), and a rubric
  benchmark for LLM-judge alignment (60 entries). All bibliographic fields
  have been audited via three independent fail-loud defenses. Wellness
  research dataset only - not for clinical decision-making.

